  2	 * The work turn (design-plan §5): a manual streaming tool loop on the native SDK.
  3	 * Code execution runs server-side; our function tools run here. A shown learning moment or a due boss ends
  4	 * the turn; skipped moments return a tool_result and the loop keeps going within the same turn.
  5	 */
